OL,3,GNEWSADrink-drive killer's proposed open
OL,4,Aprison move 'an insult'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said:
OL,7,F"Public protection is our priority, and
OL,8,Fprisoners are only moved to
OL,9,Flower-security conditions following a
OL,10,Fthorough risk assessment."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
